      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1938647293349044449",
      "text": "[6:09PM] #OpebiAllen #TrafficUpdate \n\nObafemi Awolowo Way is good from Radio Junction inward Allen Intersection and Olowu, but slightly congested toward Ikeja Under Bridge.\nIkeja Under Bridge to Allen Intersection is good traffic flow.\nAllen Intersection to Radio Junction is busy traffic conditions.\nBusy traffic on Aromire Road, both inward and outward, at Allen Intersection.\nGood traffic movement on Kudirat Abiola Way, from Ojota inward to Walfare Junction, Ikosi Junction, and down to Radio Junction, with a similarly smooth return journey.\nOpebi Link Bridge inward and outward traffic is flowing well at Walfare Junction.\nOpebi Road from Shareton Link Bridge inward to Salvation is good traffic flow.\nCongested traffic on Opebi Road from Salvation to Opebi Roundabout and Toyin.\nSmooth traffic flow from Allen Intersection back to Toyin, Opebi Roundabout, and down to Shareton Link Bridge.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
